 HTML

This repository contains my **HTML learning and practice work**, covering the fundamentals of creating and structuring web pages.

 Topics Covered

* HTML Fundamentals
* Basic HTML Structure
* Headings, Paragraphs & Text Formatting
* Links & Images
* Lists and Tables
* Forms and Input Elements
* Semantic HTML
* Non-Semantic HTML
* HTML5 Elements
* Multimedia Elements
* Page Structure and Navigation

The main goal of this repository is to build a strong foundation in **HTML and web page development** through practical examples and mini projects.
